            "detailed_description": "<strong>1166</strong> is a psychological horror game following six people in Salem, Massachusetts and how their lives change when one of them is kidnapped….<br><br><br>Fight through pain, depression, and grotesque monsters to uncover the truth. The darkness has taken a hold, will you see the light or hide in the shadows? Or will you find another way? Will you slaughter everything in your path, or take a more passive approach? The choice is yours...<br><br>Made by a one man (<i>and two cats</i>) development team, this dark mystery has simple artwork, keyboard and mouse controls, compelling multiple endings and original music. <br><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br>-Thrilling adventure with a deep story that captivates from beginning to end. <br><br>-Charming pixel-art graphics and a simple interface that gets out of your way.<br><br>-Complex characters, each with their own personality and agenda. <br><br>-Original soundtrack.<br><br>-Multiple endings, each with part of the whole story.<br><br>-Exciting combat that pushes you to move with caution.<br><br>-Available on PC, MAC, Linux. <br><br>-Occasional Pixel boob!<br><br><br>1166 contains strong adult themes and is recommended for player over 18.",
